      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LOCKDOWN (5) goes very well this course and distance starting 14 times for eight wins and three minors. Recorded a one length win (22.21) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks suited and should go close. HEY BUBBA LOUIE (4) boasts a consistent overall record including 10 wins from 40 starts, the latest hitting the minor money when third (22.73) over 388m at Gosford. Has a good record at this journey. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. DESPICABLE KYRO (2) was below best at his last start when 7th at Gosford following a second place finish (22.74) at this track two back. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Cannot be underestimated. WHITEY (7) is in form and worth thought again.",
